# Frontend: Astro 7

`frontend/src/`: pages (`pages/`), layouts (`layouts/`), styles, constants (`constants.ts`). Read
`frontend/AGENTS.md` before using an Astro API. Run: `kiln dev` (an agent runs
`astro dev --background`, then `astro dev stop`); check: `kiln check` (`astro check`).

## Code

- **[STRICT-TS]** TypeScript at Astro's `strictest` setting, in `.ts` files as in the front matter
  and the `<script>` of `.astro` files.
- **[NO-ANY]** No `any`: `unknown`, then a type narrowing.
- **[ASYNC-AWAIT]** `async/await` with `try/catch` only; `.then().catch()` chains are banned.
- **[MODERN-ASTRO]** Astro 7: content collections typed by a schema, `astro:env` for
  configuration, islands (`client:*`) only for interaction.
- **[STATIC-FIRST]** A page is rendered at build time. On-demand rendering or an island
  (`client:*`) is justified where it is used, by a need for interaction or fresh data.
- **[CONTENT-COLLECTIONS]** Editorial content (articles, documentation pages) lives in content
  collections (`src/content/`) typed by a schema: never long text written in a page.
- **[API-CALLS]** A page never calls the API inline: it goes through a typed function of
  `src/lib/` that validates the response before returning it.
- **[UI-STATES]** Every area that loads data in the browser handles the three states explicitly:
  loading, error (an understandable message) and empty list.
- **[ACCESSIBILITY]** Every field has an associated `<label>`, every icon button an `aria-label`,
  every informative image an `alt` (Astro's `<Image />`). Everything works with the keyboard and
  focus stays visible.
- **[TEST-DENSITY]** The front's test density never drops: its floor in `charter.toml` is raised
  as it goes up (floor).

## Styling

- **[STYLE-1]** No `<style>` tag in a `.astro` file: a component holds only markup (utility
  classes) and, when needed, a `<script>`.
- **[STYLE-2]** **Tailwind by default**, right in the markup. Separate CSS only for a multi-step
  animation, a native browser element or a black-box third-party component.
- **[STYLE-3]** `src/styles/global.css` is the only CSS file, imported by the base layout: it
  imports Tailwind and holds the theme tokens (`@theme`). A component writes the class of a
  token, never an arbitrary value that copies it.
- **[STYLE-5]** Banned: bursts of arbitrary classes, `@apply` to rebuild a component,
  `!important` except to override a third-party library that forces it.
{%- if level >= 2 %}

## Performance and quality

- **[CORE-WEB-VITALS]** Budgets at the 75th percentile, on mobile: **LCP < 2.5 s**,
  **INP < 200 ms**, **CLS < 0.1**. A regression beyond them blocks the release.
- **[JS-BUDGET]** A JavaScript budget per page, checked at build time.
- **[MODERN-IMAGES]** Images through `<Image />`, in AVIF/WebP, sized, loaded lazily below the
  first screen.
- **[AUTOMATED-ACCESSIBILITY]** Main pages pass an automated `axe-core` check; target
  **WCAG 2.2 level AA**.
